   "title": "Activation patching (history models)",
   "status": "done",
   "models": "exp 3, 1b, A",
   "question": "Which internal path carries the 60/60 damage to the next-keypose prediction?",
   "result": "Share recovered by restoring clean values: scene positions 51% / 18% / 13%, proprio features 45% / 79% / 88% (exp 3 / 1b / A). Clean \u03b4M or adaLN term: 0%. Positions + proprio = 100%.",
